      "text": "AI requires continuous investment not only to successfully deploy into production, but to ensure the systems we're building are resilient, responsible, and equitable.\n\nThere is a continuous requirement to constantly refresh and evaluate AI systems with fresh and new data. https://t.co/5qZuCBuqRg",
