          "id": "1488228477056610310",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "The government’s typical approach to test &amp; evaluation is one-and-done—but that approach doesn’t work for AI. It would only result in wasted tax dollars and failed experiments.\n\nThis is the start of building systems which will modernize DoD methods for the age of AI.",
